    "content": {
      "rendered": "<div id=\"fh-jobpost\">\n<div style=\"background:#E4F3EA;border-left:5px solid #1E8E4E;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 22px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#123D28;\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Honeywell Internship 2027 now has three live intern openings in Bengaluru: the &ldquo;Intern (Bachelor&rsquo;s)&rdquo; role 162285 (IT Analysis, posted 20 November), the Software Eng intern (160484) and the AI intern (161319). All three are for students still pursuing a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree. Req 162285 closes on 23 November at 3:09 PM IST, so apply to it first. Stipend and duration are not published.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background:#0F3D2A;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;padding:13px 18px;\">Honeywell Internship 2027 &mdash; job details at a glance</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Company</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Honeywell</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Roles</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Intern (Bachelor&rsquo;s) 162285 &middot; Software Eng Intern 160484 &middot; AI Intern 161319</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Location</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Bengaluru 560103 (Varthur Hobli / Ecoworld campuses), Karnataka</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Work mode</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">160484 &amp; 161319: Hybrid &middot; 162285: Not stated</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Eligibility</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Currently pursuing a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree (Engineering, Business, Computer Science or related)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Batch / CGPA</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Not stated</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Duration</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Not stated</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Stipend</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Official: Not disclosed | Reported: ~&#8377;25K&ndash;45K/month (Bengaluru intern listings on job boards; low confidence)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Apply before</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">162285: 23 Nov 2026, 3:09 PM IST &middot; others: no end date shown</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Applicants</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Internal and external &middot; no relocation package</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:0 0 24px;\"><a href=\"https://ibqbjb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/Honeywell/job/162285\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Apply: Intern (Bachelor&rsquo;s) &middot; Req 162285</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">Honeywell &middot; Bengaluru &middot; apply before 23 Nov, 3:09 PM IST</span></a><a href=\"https://ibqbjb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/Honeywell/job/160484\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Apply: Software Eng Intern &middot; Req 160484</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">Bengaluru (Hybrid) &middot; no end date shown</span></a><a href=\"https://ibqbjb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/Honeywell/job/161319\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Apply: AI Intern &middot; Req 161319</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">Bengaluru (Hybrid) &middot; no end date shown</span></a></div>\n<div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_90 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-light-blue ez-toc-container-direction\">\n<div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\"><p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Job Summary</p>\n</div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/honeywell-internship-2027/#Honeywell_Internship_2027_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\" >Honeywell Internship 2027 &ndash; full job details</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/honeywell-internship-2027/#What_you_will_do_in_the_Honeywell_Internship_2027_role\" >What you will do in the Honeywell Internship 2027 role</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/honeywell-internship-2027/#Honeywell_Internship_2027_eligibility\" >Honeywell Internship 2027 eligibility</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/honeywell-internship-2027/#Honeywell_Internship_2027_selection_process\" >Honeywell Internship 2027 selection process</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/honeywell-internship-2027/#Documents_required_for_the_Honeywell_Internship_2027\" >Documents required for the Honeywell Internship 2027</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/honeywell-internship-2027/#Preparation_tips_for_the_Honeywell_Internship_2027_interviews\" >Preparation tips for the Honeywell Internship 2027 interviews</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/honeywell-internship-2027/#How_to_apply_for_Honeywell_Internship_2027\" >How to apply for Honeywell Internship 2027</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/honeywell-internship-2027/#About_Honeywell\" >About Honeywell</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/honeywell-internship-2027/#Frequently_asked_questions\" >Frequently asked questions</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Honeywell_Internship_2027_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\"></span>Honeywell Internship 2027 &ndash; full job details<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The Honeywell Internship 2027 list on Honeywell&rsquo;s Oracle careers portal now has three open roles. On 20 November Honeywell opened req 162285 (Devarabisanahalli, Varthur Hobli), titled Intern (Bachelor&rsquo;s), under the job function &ldquo;IT Analysis&rdquo;.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Alongside it, the earlier Software Eng intern req 160484 and AI intern req 161319 are still accepting applications. Listings we covered earlier that have since closed have been removed from this page. Every role is a University Relations hire for Bengaluru.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\"><strong>Expected stipend:</strong> The Honeywell Internship 2027 listings do not publish a stipend for any role. Bengaluru intern listings on job boards suggest roughly &#8377;25,000&ndash;45,000 a month, but the sample is small, so treat it as a rough guide and ask the recruiter for the exact figure in writing.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#FDEBEA;border-left:5px solid #C8372B;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#5B1A14;\"><strong>Current students only:</strong> every Honeywell Internship 2027 listing asks for someone still pursuing (or enrolled in) a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree. If you have already graduated, these internships are not meant for you.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFF6E3;border-left:5px solid #E1A006;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A3706;\"><strong>Template gaps in listing 162285:</strong> the short description of 162285 still shows unfilled placeholders for the manager title, city and work mode, and the &ldquo;must have&rdquo; line only says experience in a similar field &ldquo;should be enough&rdquo;. Confirm the work mode, team and duration once you are contacted.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"What_you_will_do_in_the_Honeywell_Internship_2027_role\"></span>What you will do in the Honeywell Internship 2027 role<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The Intern (Bachelor&rsquo;s) listing 162285 describes general support work rather than a fixed tech stack:</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Help the team with routine tasks and ongoing projects</li>\n<li>Work on data analysis and prepare reports</li>\n<li>Research topics and collect information for projects</li>\n<li>Coordinate with teams from other functions</li>\n<li>Take part in team meetings and offer ideas</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The Software Eng intern (160484) focuses on applying software engineering basics, joining code reviews and building software with cross-functional teams. The AI intern (161319) only has a short summary: helping design and build AI algorithms, models and systems alongside AI engineers.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Honeywell_Internship_2027_eligibility\"></span>Honeywell Internship 2027 eligibility<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li><strong>Intern (Bachelor&rsquo;s) 162285:</strong> pursuing a Bachelor&rsquo;s in a relevant field such as Engineering, Business or Computer Science; analytical and problem-solving ability; comfort working in a team</li>\n<li><strong>Software Eng 160484:</strong> enrolled in a Bachelor&rsquo;s in Software Engineering or a related field, with a basic grasp of software development; Java, Python or C++ is valued</li>\n<li><strong>AI 161319:</strong> no detailed qualification list is published; the summary points to interest in AI models and systems</li>\n<li><strong>Not confirmed:</strong> graduation year, CGPA cut-off, backlog rules and branch restrictions are not stated in any listing</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Honeywell_Internship_2027_selection_process\"></span>Honeywell Internship 2027 selection process<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Honeywell has not published the selection process for the Honeywell Internship 2027 roles. Based on how its campus-style intern hiring usually runs, plan for these stages:</p>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Resume shortlisting against the listing</li>\n<li>An online assessment (aptitude, logic and basic coding for tech roles)</li>\n<li>One or two technical or functional interviews</li>\n<li>An HR or manager conversation about availability and fit</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Documents_required_for_the_Honeywell_Internship_2027\"></span>Documents required for the Honeywell Internship 2027<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>An updated one-page resume (build one with our free <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/resume-builder/\">Resume Builder</a>)</li>\n<li>College ID or a bonafide letter showing you are currently enrolled</li>\n<li>Latest semester mark sheets</li>\n<li>A short list of projects with GitHub or portfolio links, if you have them</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Preparation_tips_for_the_Honeywell_Internship_2027_interviews\"></span>Preparation tips for the Honeywell Internship 2027 interviews<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>For the IT Analysis role, practise Excel, basic SQL and reading a simple dataset to explain a trend</li>\n<li>For the software and AI roles, revise one language (Java, Python or C++), data structures and one project end to end</li>\n<li>Use our <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/tools/\">free career tools</a> to practise aptitude and polish your profile</li>\n<li>Prepare a crisp opener with our <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/self-introduction-for-interview/\">self-introduction guide</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"How_to_apply_for_Honeywell_Internship_2027\"></span>How to apply for Honeywell Internship 2027<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Start with req 162285 because it closes first: <a href=\"https://ibqbjb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/Honeywell/job/162285\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">apply for Honeywell Intern (Bachelor&rsquo;s) 162285</a> before 23 November, 3:09 PM IST</li>\n<li>Software students can also <a href=\"https://ibqbjb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/Honeywell/job/160484\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">apply for Software Eng intern 160484</a>, and AI-focused students for <a href=\"https://ibqbjb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/Honeywell/job/161319\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">AI intern 161319</a></li>\n<li>Sign in or create a Honeywell candidate profile, upload your resume and answer the screening questions</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Each Honeywell Internship 2027 requisition is a separate application, and Honeywell does not say whether they share one shortlist, so apply to every role that fits you.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#F3F6F4;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#43514A;\"><strong>Related:</strong> see the <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/honeywell-off-campus-drive-2027/\">Honeywell Off Campus Drive 2027</a> for full-time roles, and browse more <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/companies-hiring-freshers/\">companies hiring freshers</a> this month.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"About_Honeywell\"></span>About Honeywell<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Honeywell is a US-headquartered industrial technology company working across aerospace, building automation, industrial automation and energy. Its Bengaluru campuses host large engineering and IT teams, and the Honeywell Internship 2027 roles give students a first look at how those teams work.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Frequently_asked_questions\"></span>Frequently asked questions<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">What is the stipend for the Honeywell Internship 2027?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Honeywell has not disclosed the stipend. Job-board listings for Bengaluru interns suggest roughly &#8377;25,000&ndash;45,000 a month, but that is a low-confidence estimate, not an official offer.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Who can apply for the Honeywell Internship 2027?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Students currently pursuing a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree. The Intern (Bachelor&rsquo;s) role names Engineering, Business and Computer Science as examples; the software role asks for Software Engineering or a related field. No batch or CGPA cut-off is stated.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">When does req 162285 close?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Req 162285 closes on 23 November 2026 at 3:09 PM IST. The Software Eng intern 160484 and AI intern 161319 show no end date, so they stay open until Honeywell takes them down.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Where is the Honeywell Internship 2027 located?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">All three roles are in Bengaluru (pin code 560103). The software and AI roles are hybrid; the Intern (Bachelor&rsquo;s) listing 162285 does not state a work mode.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">How do I apply?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Use the official Honeywell links in the &ldquo;How to apply&rdquo; section, create a candidate profile and submit your resume for each role that fits you.</p>\n</details>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:0 0 24px;\"><a href=\"https://ibqbjb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/Honeywell/job/162285\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Apply: Intern (Bachelor&rsquo;s) &middot; Req 162285</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">Honeywell &middot; Bengaluru &middot; apply before 23 Nov, 3:09 PM IST</span></a><a href=\"https://ibqbjb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/Honeywell/job/160484\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Apply: Software Eng Intern &middot; Req 160484</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">Bengaluru (Hybrid) &middot; no end date shown</span></a><a href=\"https://ibqbjb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/Honeywell/job/161319\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Apply: AI Intern &middot; Req 161319</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">Bengaluru (Hybrid) &middot; no end date shown</span></a></div>\n<p><a id=\"fh-apply-src\" href=\"https://ibqbjb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/Honeywell/job/162285\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" hidden target=\"_blank\">Apply on official portal</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Intern (Bachelor’s)\",\"description\":\"Internship for students pursuing a Bachelor’s degree (Engineering, Business, Computer Science or related). Support team projects, data analysis, reporting and research with cross-functional teams in Bengaluru.\",\"identifier\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Honeywell\",\"value\":\"162285\"},\"datePosted\":\"2026-11-20\",\"employmentType\":\"INTERN\",\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organizatio